{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_103_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，公伐邾。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"二、三月，甲戌，取須句。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"取邑不日，此其日何也？不正其再取，故謹而日之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"三、遂城郚。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"遂，繼事也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"四、夏，四月，宋公王臣卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"五、宋人殺其大夫。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"稱人以殺，誅有罪也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"六、戊子，晉人及秦人戰於令狐，晉先蔑奔秦。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"不言出，在外也。輟戰而奔秦，以是為逃軍也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"七、狄侵我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"八、秋，八月，公會諸侯、晉大夫盟於扈。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"其曰諸侯，略之也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"九、冬，徐伐莒。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"十、公孫敖如莒莅盟。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_103_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_103","textTraditional":"莅，位也。其曰位何也？前定也。其不日，前定之盟不日也。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}